<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>能力三 · 管得住</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.42)', marginTop: 8 }}>智能家居能不能落地，取决于这道闸</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 48 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 500, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 26px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FB7185', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 700 }}>场景</Text>
                <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.06)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px', marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.75)' }}>你说：「打开门锁」</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.50)', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 14 }}>↓</Text>
                <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.12)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>它先问：「确认要开门锁吗？」</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 18 }}>
                    小明（青岛家）也看不到你深圳家的任何设备。<br />
                    越权访问直接拦下，设备状态一点不动。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(251,113,133,0.40)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FB7185', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 1</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>护栏是独立的一道闸</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>不是散落在各处的 if——那样会漏。把"该不该做"收成唯一一个裁决点。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(251,113,133,0.40)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FB7185', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 2</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>高危动作强制二次确认</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>门锁、燃气这类，先回显、确认了才执行——误操作比漏操作严重得多。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(251,113,133,0.40)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FB7185', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>一家一个家，越权即拦</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>每个账号只能碰自己家的设备；跨家庭访问返回 403，且零副作用。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居 AI 管家</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>09 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
